    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Can wi ju ma ng’olo lembang’ola mi gondri, man ni jugor ma goro lembang’ola ma kite mbe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara ulok jacanpiny cen ni pokolembe, man kara ukwal ng’ol migi ba jucan mi dhanu para, kara mon ma coggi tho bed ayeki migi, man kara gidwok kic ni amaci migi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E wubitimo ang’o i ceng’ mi lieu, man i nyoth ma biai bon? wubiringo ba ng’a mi konyi? man wubiweko dwong’ mu kani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibigung’ piny kende the jukol, man gibipodho the ju ma junego. Kadok maeni ceke timbre ng’ecwiny pare lokre cen ungo, ento cinge rieire asu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.14.24+ISA.14.25+ISA.14.26+ISA.14.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 14:24-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Nah 1:1-3:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.2.13+ZEP.2.14+ZEP.2.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef 2:13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Jaascuri, in i uluth mi ng’ecwiny para, in i dul ma kwinyo para ni i cingi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiore kum thek m’ucido, man abimio ire ng’ol kum dhanu mi kwinyo para, kara emak ayeki, man emak amaci, man kara enyongi piny calu unzabu m’i gengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ekeco kumeno ngo, kadok adundene pido kumeno ngo; ento eni i adundene ya enyothi, man ekab thek woko ma nok ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ewacu kumae, Judongomawijo para ceke gin ubimo ngo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalno calu Karkemic ungo? Hamath calu Arpad ungo? Samaria calu Dameski ngo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Calu cinga nwang’u ker mi mungu m’araga, ma ayi gin m’apaya migi sagu mi ju mi Yerusalem ku mi Samaria; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abitimo kum Yerusalem ungo ku mungu m’aragane, calu atimo kum Samaria ku mungu m’aragane?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno ebitimbre, nia, kinde ma Rwoth utimo tic pare ceke wi got Sayuni man kum Yerusalem, e abisendo nying adunde ma tek mir ubimo mir Ascur, man dwong’ mi nen pare ma malu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ewacu kumae, Ku tego m’i cinga atimo maeni, man ku rieko para; kum abedo ku ng’eyong’ec: man akabu kieu mi kodhidhanu, man ayaku piny m’akana migi, man calu jarukara ajwigo ju m’ujany wi komker piny: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man cinga nwang’u lonyo mi kodhidhanu calu uthaj winyo; man calu ng’atu moko coko tong’gweno ma juweko, acoko ng’om ngung’ kumeca: man ng’atu moko mbe m’uting’o bomb, kadi m’ung’amu dhok, kadi m’ukok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lei bilule gire kum ng’atu m’upayu kude pinyi? jamtic biyungre gire kum ng’atu m’uthumo kude pinyi? calu ma tek dul ubimo wi ju m’uting’e malu, calu ma tek uluth uting’ ng’atu moko malu ma en e yen ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Rwoth, Yehova mir udul, bioro mok ma jumok ko kind jupare m’ucwe; man jubicwinyo wang’u ma calu wang’upiny mi mac the dwong’ pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man der mir Israel bibedo ni mac, man Ng’atu Maleng’ pare ni lebmac; e ebiwang’u man ebicamu ukudho pare kud ucok pare i ceng’ acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ebiwang’u dwong’ mi luli pare, man mi podho pare ma cek hai, ng’eyong’ec ku kum bende: man ebibedo calu kinde ma jayei abera voc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dong yen mi luli pare bibedo nok, ketho nia nyathin copo goro welgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebtimbre i ceng’ maeca, nia dong Israel m’udong’, ku ju m’uboth mi ot pa Yakobo, bijengri kendo ngo kum ng’atu m’ugoyogi, ento gibijengri kum Yehova, Ng’atu Maleng’ mir Israel, i lemandha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Donge m’udong’ bidwogo, en e dong Yakobo, ba Mungu ma Jatego. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 9:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kadok dhanu peri, ma Israel, bedo calu kwio mi nam, donge kende e ma gibidwogo: jukeco nyoth, m’upong’ hau ku bedopwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Rwoth, Yehova mir udul, bitimo kajik ma pong’, ma jukeco, i die ng’om ngung’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Rwoth, Yehova mir udul, uwacu kumae, E dhanu para m’ubedo i Sayuni lworo kud unegwu kum Jaascuri, kadok egoi ku dul, man eting’o uluth pare i kumi, calu kura Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum fodi nindo dong’ nyandwikili, e kwinyo bitimbre kakare i kumi, man ng’ecwiny para kum nyoth pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehova mir udul bicwaku goc ma tek i kume, calu i nek mi Midian kum cana pa Oreb: man uluth pare bibedo wi nam, man ebiting’e malu calu kura mi Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre i ceng’ maeca, nia ter pare biai ku wi goki, man mberembere pare kud i ng’uti, man mberemberene binyothre ni kum mio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
